@startuml
title Chat agent: bounded tool-selection loop
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
start
:User question + checkpointed chat history;
:Deterministic input boundary\nRetrieve public guidance; reset round count;
repeat
  if (Fewer than six tool rounds?) then (yes)
    :LLM: answer or request tools;
  else (no)
    :Final LLM call with no tools bound;
  endif
  if (Tool calls requested?) then (yes)
    :Tool boundary\nget_accounts / get_debts / get_spending\nsearch_kb / plan_debt_payoff;
    if (User-data tool?) then (yes)
      :Privacy input boundary\nMinimize, scrub, pseudonymize, audit;
    else (public guidance)
      :Public guidance result;
    endif
    :Tool results or safe tool errors\nreturned to model; increment round count;
  endif
repeat while (Tool calls requested?) is (yes) not (no)
:Output boundary: stream answer and sources\nPersist conversation and tool results;
stop
note right
  Six rounds, possibly multiple calls per round.
  Initial retrieval is not a model choice.
  Retrieved links do not prove claim support.
  Gateway audit covers its financial context,
  not the complete conversation prompt.
end note
@enduml
